WEBVTT

00:05:58.116 --> 00:06:00.276
but the window of opportunity is closing.

00:06:00.316 --> 00:06:02.196
Which brings me back to you.

00:06:02.796 --> 00:06:04.796
You're the reason that I have hope.

00:06:04.836 --> 00:06:06.116
Time and time again,

00:06:06.156 --> 00:06:09.036
we've seen that when people
raise their voices,

00:06:09.076 --> 00:06:11.236
that chorus becomes too urgent

00:06:11.276 --> 00:06:14.356
and too loud for leaders to ignore.

00:06:14.396 --> 00:06:17.196
That chorus for bold
climate action is growing,

00:06:17.196 --> 00:06:19.196
but it's in fits and starts.

00:06:19.196 --> 00:06:23.156
Climate change doesn't pause,
and neither must we.

00:06:23.196 --> 00:06:26.476
Now, last I checked,
every single person in this room

00:06:26.476 --> 00:06:28.196
and all those watching online,

00:06:28.236 --> 00:06:31.636
teachers, presidents,
shareholders, chief executives,